  "rune_name_patterns": [
    "Set runes: '<Set name> <Roman numeral I-VI>' (e.g. \"Trapper's Legacy I\", \"Venomfang VI\") for Trapper's Legacy, Deadeye's Resolve, Venomfang",
    "Set runes: '<Set name> Rune (<Roman numeral>)' (e.g. 'Eye of the Storm Rune (II)', \"Serpent's Tongue Rune (III)\")",
    "Exception: set 'Strong Shield of the Atheron' runes are named \"Rune of Atheron's Shield (I)\"..\"(VI)\"",
    "Ability runes: '<Ability name> Rune' (e.g. 'Cleave Rune', 'Fire Ball Rune'), Rare, class-specific",
